bed crew-neck knit top, tucked into high-waisted muted-olive straight-leg trousers. The blazer has notched lapels, two dark front buttons and two flap pockets. The trousers fall neatly to the instep with a light break above smooth black leather penny loafers. A small structured chocolate-brown shoulder bag with a short strap rests at her side.\n\nOne hand lightly holds the bag strap while the other hangs naturally. Her walking stance reveals the trouser silhouette, both shoes and the layering beneath the open blazer. Eye-level street photography, soft morning daylight, realistic skin and fabric textures, and a gently softened architectural background. Keep the entire outfit visible from head to shoes.\n\nThe right forty-five percent contains five neatly spaced flat-lay garment studies, photographed directly overhead against the same warm ivory surface. They show exactly the same items worn by the woman, with consistent colors, materials, buttons, pockets and silhouettes. These are individual, separated product photographs, not additional portraits.\n\nEach item is fully visible, accompanied by a numbered Chinese heading and a compact, legible description. Arrange them as a slim editorial column: the open blazer at the top, the sleeveless knit below it, the full-length trousers next, and the loafers and handbag side by side at the bottom. Place the small silver hoop earrings next to the handbag. Preserve natural garment proportions and subtle contact shadows. Use tidy spacing so no garment overlaps another item's text.\n\nBeside the charcoal blazer, write:\n\"01｜炭灰西装\"\n\"微宽肩＋直线剪裁，敞开穿更轻松。袖口轻挽，露出手腕。\"\n\nBeside the ivory sleeveless ribbed knit top, write:\n\"02｜奶油白针织\"\n\"圆领贴合颈部，细罗纹增加层次。衣摆收进裤腰，突出腰线。\"\n\nBeside the muted-olive trousers, write:\n\"03｜橄榄绿直筒裤\"\n\"高腰设计，裤管自然垂落。裤脚轻触鞋面，线条干净利落。\"\n\nBelow the pair of black loafers, write:\n\"04｜黑色乐福鞋\"\n\"圆方鞋头＋低跟，露出鞋面，保持轻盈比例。\"\n\nBelow the chocolate-brown bag and silver earrings, write:\n\"05｜棕色包＋银饰\"\n\"小体积肩包收住轮廓，银色耳圈点亮面部。\"\n\nAcross the lower portion of the page, underneath the photograph and flat-lay studies, place a clearly separated Chinese styling-notes section headed \"搭配思路\". Include three concise lines:\n\n\"配色：奶油白提亮，炭灰稳住，橄榄绿增加变化。\"\n\"比例：上衣收腰，外套敞开，保留完整的纵向线条。\"\n\"细节：包与鞋用深色呼应，首饰保持小巧简洁。\"\n\nAlong the bottom edge, add the small text:\n\"适合场景：日常通勤／周末看展／城市散步\"\n\nFollow with the tag line:\n\"#今日穿搭 #通勤穿搭 #穿搭拆解\"\n\nKeep the page visually coherent: the photographed outfit and every flat-lay item must match exactly. Use confident Chinese headings, compact but readable body text and restrained editorial annotations. All visible text is simplified Chinese exactly as supplied, apart from the numbering and hashtag symbols. Avoid fake prices, brand logos, app interface elements, engagement counts and decorative pseudo-text. Crisp product detail, natural street photography and carefully balanced information density create an approachable, save-worthy outfit guide."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 1, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.41.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [8], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [482.5751953125, 140.190673828125], "pos": [1031.8724365234375, 1791.9569091796875], "widgets_values": ["moss_image_base_bf16.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "unet_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "label": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "weight_dtype"}], "flags": {}, "id": 1, "type": "UNETLoader", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": 